# PLACE SCRIPT of program 1 hanoi_moves (Raku), developer_13 2026-11-23, written from the program's own text, to be read by the cqo: at [cell, line, col] (cells from 0 among the code cells, lines and columns from 1), the act, what the person must meet; word is the text at the place. Cell 0 holds the record sub and the two structures, cell 1 the recursive hanoi, cell 2 the run and the tally.
